<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50/1.00 up - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50/1.00 up - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50-1.00 higher. Demand was moderate to good on a moderate movement. Top $58.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>				 Country				Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 LBS. 56.00-57.00 Few 55.50 &amp; 57.50   56.50-58.25</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 LBS. 51.00-55.00</p>
<p>	  210-230 LBS. 46.00-51.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Steady to Firm. Top 48.50. US 1-3  300-500 LBS. 42.00-44.50 Few 41.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 LBS. 44.50-47.50</p>
<p>Few over 600 LBS. 47.50-48.50</p>
</text>
